  "notes": "{減|へ}る is an intransitive verb meaning to decrease or diminish in quantity or amount.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{自動詞|じどうし}→自動詞：10977_jidoushi⟧ (intransitive)\n- Pair: ⟦{減|へ}らす→減らす：02414_herasu⟧ (transitive, to reduce)\n\nASPECT (ている):\n{減|へ}って⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ indicates a state of having decreased or being reduced.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{人口|じんこう}→人口：01618_jinkou⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{減|へ}る: population decreases\n- ⟦{売|う}り{上|あ}げ→売上：04102_uriage⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{減|へ}る: sales decrease\n- ⟦{体重|たいじゅう}→体重：03395_taijuu⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{減|へ}る: weight decreases\n- ⟦お{腹|なか}→お腹：00805_onaka⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{減|へ}る: to be hungry (lit. stomach becomes empty)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {減|へ}る: to decrease (intransitive)\n- ⟦{増|ふ}える→増える：01183_fueru⟧: to increase (intransitive)\n\nUSAGE:\n⟦お{腹|なか}→お腹：00805_onaka⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{減|へ}った is a casual way to say \"I'm hungry.\" More polite: ⟦お{腹|なか}→お腹：00805_onaka⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧⟦{空|す}き→すく：00756_suku⟧ました.",
